+
+    println!(
+        "LEGACY WORLD-OFFSET ESTIMATE at k x camera distance ({vp_w:.0}x{vp_h:.0}), retained for BEFORE comparison only; margin = best cover's (separation along the ray - its face push) - the outline's lift"
